# QY Roam Meta ad drafts

Launch guardrail: **do not publish above S$10/day total live spend without approval.**

## Campaign A — Singapore outbound travellers
Objective: Sales / website purchases
Audience: Singapore, age 21–60; broad travel intent; start broad before adding interest restrictions.
Budget: S$6/day at launch.

### Ad 1 — Simple value
Primary text: Travelling soon? Keep your phone, laptop and travel companions connected with one pocket WiFi. QY Roam delivers to your Singapore address before departure, with easy return after your trip. Launch rates from S$1.84/day for selected Asian destinations.
Headline: Pocket WiFi from S$1.84/day
Description: Delivered in Singapore. Secure online checkout.
CTA: Book Now

### Ad 2 — Group travel
Primary text: One travel WiFi. Multiple devices. Less roaming hassle. Book your destination and dates online, get the device couriered to you in Singapore, then return it after your trip.
Headline: Share WiFi Across Your Travel Group
Description: Singapore support: +65 8032 7183
CTA: Learn More

## Campaign B — Japan & Korea travellers
Objective: Sales / website purchases
Audience: Singapore travellers interested in Japan and South Korea travel.
Budget: S$4/day at launch.

### Ad 1 — Japan/Korea
Primary text: Japan or Korea trip coming up? QY Roam pocket WiFi keeps your devices connected without swapping SIMs. Singapore delivery, easy return, and launch rates from S$1.84/day.
Headline: Japan & Korea Pocket WiFi
Description: Book online before you fly.
CTA: Book Now

## Measurement
Pixel events planned: PageView, ViewContent, InitiateCheckout, Purchase.
Purchase should be deduplicated using the Stripe Checkout Session ID as the Meta event_id for browser/server events where both are enabled.

## Creative direction
Use clean travel imagery with a small pocket WiFi device in foreground, airport/departure cues, and one strong price message. Avoid unsupported speed/coverage superlatives. Show "From S$1.84/day" only on destinations where that launch price applies.
